<title>JAPAN: S&amp;P assigns AAA to Aquarius Asset Funding's notes.</title>
<headline>S&amp;P assigns AAA to Aquarius Asset Funding's notes.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-07-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Standard and Poor's Corp said on Thursday that it had assigned an AAA rating to Aquarius Asset Funding Corp's 10 billion yen worth of series one notes.</p>
<p>The notes are secured by a pool of equipment lease receivables totalling about 14.5 billion yen originated by Japan Leasing Corp, S&amp;P said in a statement.</p>
